note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Private graph-owned context tuple lookup, not a qualification or artifact schema.
note Tuple4 is operation kind, layer index, window start, window rows.
note keys capacity128; up to32 active tuples stride4. Unused cells ignored.
fn pc_same keys view ulong 128 off ulong actual view ulong 4 to bool
for j ulong 4
if ne get keys add off j get actual j
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
note Return unique 1-based context ordinal,0 absent,-1 invalid count/duplicate match.
fn native_context keys view ulong 128 count ulong actual view ulong 4 to long
if gt count 32
ret -1
end
hit = long 0
for i ulong count
if pc_same keys mul i 4 actual
if ne hit 0
ret -1
end
hit = long add i 1
end
end
ret hit
end
